#22200
Credit Room for the Proving Grounds Area~
   I wrote this area to be used in conjunction with Digger's "arena" code
which allows players to fight each other and die without losing any xp.  
Hopefully players will come here and learn how to be better mudders without
having to lose hard-earned xp.               -- Keil 
~
222 512 0 0 0 3 255 0
