Entrance to the Proving Grounds~
   This room is roughly 20' by 20', its walls made entirely of logs.  A 
window is centered in the south wall, and long benches beckon you to take
a load off your tired feet.  There is a notice posted on the wall.  
~
222 2490900 0 0 0 0 255 0
D0
~
~
0 0 4440
D1
Your fate awaits you there.
~
~
0 0 22210
D3
Your fate awaits you there.
~
