0 0 22291
E
window~
Through the window you see a breathtaking view of a lush forest.
~
E
notice sign~


               ****  Welcome to the Proving Grounds  ****

The forest beyond the east and west exits is an area where you may settle
a grudge, hone your killing skills, compete with your friends, or just 
kill time (and each other).  The east and west exits lead to different 
sections of the forest.  Once you enter the forest you may only exit by  
being defeated, using word of recall, or getting summoned.

Have fun!

The Management
~
